# The pipeline writes LF unconditionally, and CI asserts that regenerating
# `data/` produces a byte-identical result. If Git rewrote line endings on
# checkout, that check would fail on Windows and pass on Linux — so line endings
# are pinned to LF everywhere rather than left to core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
